for Japanese fascists in the 2nd World War.</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"portrait-card\">\n                <div class=\"portrait-placeholder placeholder\">\n                    [Photo: Portrait of Hussein Onn]\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"portrait-info typewriter\">\n                    <div class=\"portrait-name\">HUSSEIN ONN</div>\n                    <div>Prime Minister of Malaysia</div>\n                    <div>Trained by the British army in Malaya, India, Middle-East</div>\n                    <div>Graduate from LINCOLN's INN (London)</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"crimes-section\">\n            <div class=\"crimes-headline\">\n                PERPETRATORS OF CRIMES AGAINST THE<br>\n                PEOPLE OF MALAYSIA AND SINGAPORE\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"typewriter crimes-intro\">\n                To maintain the interests of British and other foreign capital<br>\n                and the local elites, THEY\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"typewriter crimes-list\">\n                <div class=\"crimes-list-item\">\n                    <div class=\"crimes-list-bullet\">:</div>\n                    <div>SUPPRESS workers' and peasants' rights.</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"crimes-list-item\">\n                    <div class=\"crimes-list-bullet\">:</div>\n                    <div>BAN independent trade unions and student unions.</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"crimes-list-item\">\n                    <div class=\"crimes-list-bullet\">:</div>\n                    <div>MANIPULATE judicial process.</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"crimes-list-item\">\n                    <div class=\"crimes-list-bullet\">:</div>\n                    <div>SUPPRESS parliamentary democracy and press freedom.</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"headline-middle\">THEY JAIL AND KILL PEOPLE</div>\n\n    <div class=\"british-box\">\n        <div class=\"british-title\">THE BRITISH CONNECTION</div>\n        \n        <div class=\"typewriter british-top-text\">\n            RUBBER AND TIN from colonial Malaya were crucial to British<br>\n            post-war recovery.\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"british-middle-row\">\n            <div class=\"british-img-placeholder placeholder\">\n                [Photo: Man working on rubber tree]\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"typewriter british-middle-text\">\n                <p>\"Without Malaya, the Sterling System, as we know<br>it could not exist.\" Purcell</p>\n                <p>A 12-year British Military Rule was imposed after<br>the World War II to protect British economic interests.</p>\n                <p>Repressive laws were first introduced by the British<br>colonial regime, then further improved by the local<br>elites.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"british-img-placeholder placeholder\">\n                [Photo: British soldiers with bicycles]\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"typewriter british-bottom-text\">\n            <p style=\"margin: 0 0 5px 0;\">Though formally 'independent', Britain CONTINUES to exert influence<br>and control through</p>\n            <div class=\"british-list-item\">\n                <div class=\"british-list-bullet\">-</div>\n                <div>Domination of the economies</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"british-list-item\">\n                <div class=\"british-list-bullet\">-</div>\n                <div>Collaboration with the repressive regimes</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"british-list-item\">\n                <div class=\"british-list-bullet\">-</div>\n                <div>Cultural subversion</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"british-list-item\">\n                <div class=\"british-list-bullet\">-</div>\n                <div>Five-Power-Defence-Arrangement (U.K., Australia, New Zealand,<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;Malaysia and Singapore).</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bottom-container\">\n        <div class=\"bottom-left-content\">\n            <div class=\"bottom-headline-group\">\n                <div>BELIEVED TO BE IN LONDON ATTENDING</div>\n                <div>THE COMMONWEALTH P.M. CONF.</div>\n                <div>JUNE 8-16, 1977</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"typewriter publisher-info\">\n                <div>Published by COBRA and NUS</div>\n                <div class=\"publisher-row\">\n                    <div class=\"publisher-label\">COBRA -</div>\n                    <div>Conference for Basic Human and Democratic Rights in the ASEAN alliance<br>6, Endsleigh Street &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;London WC1</div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"slanted-box\">\n            <div class=\"slanted-title\">PICKET LEE AND HUSSEIN ONN</div>\n            <div class=\"typewriter slanted-details\">\n                <div class=\"slanted-row\">\n                    <div class=\"slanted-label\">Place:</div>\n                    <div>Parliament Square, London SW1</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"slanted-row\">\n                    <div class=\"slanted-label\">Date :</div>\n                    <div>9th June 1977</div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"slanted-row\">\n                    <div class=\"slanted-label\">Time :</div>\n                    <div>5 to 9 p.m.</div>\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">SEND LETTERS/TELEGRAMS of protest</div>\n                <div class=\"slanted-row\">\n                    <div class=\"slanted-label\">c/o</div>\n                    <div>Commonwealth Secretariat,<br>Marlborough House,<br>London SW1.</div>\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"margin-top: 10px; text-align: right;\">Copies to COBRA.</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
